From: ucab04b8f0759c712 at groups.google.com (Daniel Lee)
Date: Fri, 04 Dec 2015 20:39:11 +0000
Subject: Re: [stan-users] Re: Complex model, slow warmup, how to diagnose?
Message-ID: <L7Tn89jcqGw.QjMc1iVEDAAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <L7Tn89jcqGw.e6ADd1lCDAAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
References: <L7Tn89jcqGw.nlxPXSFCDAAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com> <L7Tn89jcqGw.e6ADd1lCDAAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
