Date: Fri, 11 Dec 2015 16:34:23 +0000
Subject: two level mediation model
Message-ID: <6FBPugBQDWo.TisnMABBAgAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/stan-users/c/6FBPugBQDWo/m/TisnMABBAgAJ>
