Subject: speeding up zero inflation model through vectorization?
Message-ID: <xOuhDRdQUXE.sdfJ52bkBQAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/stan-users/c/xOuhDRdQUXE/m/sdfJ52bkBQAJ>
